  "output_text": "```python\ndef primes_below(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Yield prime numbers below n.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 2:\n        return\n    # Sieve of Eratosthenes\n    sieve = [True] * n\n    sieve[0] = False\n    sieve[1] = False\n    for i in range(2, int(n**0.5) + 1):\n        if sieve[i]:\n            for j in range(i * i, n, i):\n                sieve[j] = False\n    for i in range(2, n):\n        if sieve[i]:\n            yield i\n\n\n# Tests\ndef test_primes_below():\n    # Test with small n\n    assert list(primes_below(10)) == [2, 3, 5, 7]\n    assert list(primes_below(2)) == []\n    assert list",
